{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/327799-rumors-prometheans-pandorans-and-the-principles","id":327799,"title":"Rumors: Prometheans, Pandorans, and the Principles","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-01T22:45:04-08:00","id":327799,"title":"Rumors: Prometheans, Pandorans, and the Principles","content":"<a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/download/2ls4xd2jn5bf5pj/World+of+Darkness+Rumors.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mediafire.com/download/2l...ess+Rumors.pdf</a><br /> <br /> Based on this file, I'm spearheading a 2.0 Rumors project to create even more awesome plot hooks, story ideas, and paradigm shifts that anyone can use at their table. If you have an awesome idea for a rumor, story, or legend, post it here, and by next February we'll decide who's story passed the bar to be included.<br /> <br /> This thread is focused on Prometheans, Pandorans, and the natures of Flux, Pyros, and the Principal itself; ideas not pertaining to these in some form will automatically not be included.<br /> <br /> Ready...set...go!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":483,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","user":"Flyboy254","date":". 12-02-2014, 01:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T11:45:44-08:00","id":328511,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't you think it is weird that Sulfur, being such an important ingredient in the eyes of the ancient alchemists, doesn't have a Refinement? I mean, it even has the symbol for &quot;soul&quot; or &quot;spirit of life&quot;! Well, I've heard that there is such a Refinement- and that they think that the best way to become human is to learn how to manipulate souls- and worse, to steal one for themselves. There is a reason they are called &quot;devils&quot;&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T13:46:18-08:00","id":328587,"title":"","content":"&quot;Someone's uploading home movies to YouTube. Yeah, like, of their kid and stuff. She started with the body parts and the needles and thread and is all the way up to first words now.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T05:10:04-08:00","id":329116,"title":"","content":"&quot;You know how there are some people that don't get hit by Disquiet so much? Yeah, not very many I know, but they do show up. Well, there are places like that too, that won't Waste when we stop there. Never seen one myself, but Mr Asphalt said he'd met someone who'd spent a year in a ghost town that never Wasted no matter how much Fire he used.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The Frankensteins didn't really start with Frankenstein you know; that really was just a book. But they did start around then and there, all the Galvanists and such. That line has two or three first ones going for it too; that's why there are so many of them.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Bullshit. The big F's family are still around. They hunt us these days, 'making up for his sin' they call it. Bastards.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The Qashmalim are us. When you make it to Mortality, the Fire doesn't just disappear - your body gets it new soul and turns human, the rest of you ends up an Angel.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-06T00:33:40-08:00","id":332016,"title":"","content":"&quot;Why do the angels help us? God sure as shit isn't on our side, and if I've learned one thing in this world, it's that nobody does something for nothing. No, those angels want something from us, and they get it when we become real. One gal in my throng thinks they just want the Fire back, but I doubt it; they could just crack us open and take it if that were true. See, I think the angels like us better as humans than as fakes. We're weaker that way. Easier to control. The whole damn Pilgrimage? It's a plot to make sure there's nobody left that can make the Fire dance like they can. Angels are jealous motherfuckers.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T10:50:47-08:00","id":333216,"title":"","content":"&quot;You see the Qashmallim? Well they have opposites, like; they're the electricity and these demons are the machines. Honest to Verney, and there's one up a ways north of Boston. He lives inside an antique dealer and trades in souls and I know someone who bought one! This is our ticket to mortality, man! What did he trade? I think he just did a few favors. How bad could it be?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":685,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","user":"Ben Quo","date":". 12-07-2014, 10:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T15:21:21-08:00","id":333481,"title":"","content":"Here's a rumor for the refinement of Silver: <br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah I've run into the Twisted Flesh. . . . You call them Pandorans. You either run from them or you kill them. But it's the smart ones you have to worry about. Because then there's a third option. Worship! Yeah you heard me right. And it ain't us doing the bowing and scraping. You know those mortals that have power? Mages, yeah right. Nosey bastards. I've seen them in a basement down by the YMCA, all chanting in tongues to this pillar of black oil and insect eyes. The worst part? One of our own was chained in the corner. No doubt being used as some sort of battery for the Twisted Flesh to keep off Dormancy. I'm ending this little cult tonight, you joining up or what?&quot; <br /> <br /> The Carousel <br /> <br /> &quot;The Fair ain't what it used to be!Fact is after the Great Depression, there was this one traveling sideshow that went all through Gentum County! Didn't stay in one place for too long. Used be when I was a young buck that the boys and I would get shitfaced and go see the shows when It came to town.<br /> <br /> Oh it had the usual rides, a ferris wheel, a carousel, a few of those ring toss games. The Carnies gave me the creeps. Don't know why, but almost everybody who worked the machines seem . . . off. . . The way they watched everybody more Than the machines they were operating. One of them had tattoos all over his body. He show me how by just moving his muscles that he could make them dance and move. Funny thing was, they seemed to move even when he wash't flexing . . .<br /> <br /> But it was the Freak show and the Burlesque stage that really drew in the crowds! What's Burlesque? . . . You're a little too young for that, but let me just tell you those women who danced looked like they were cut right out of stone. Flawless! And the freaks? I never thought God in His Heaven would ever make a man looking like the ones I saw in the tent. And the way they smiled at us, like WE we're the ones on display.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3857-kingme1","name":"Kingme1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T19:52:58-08:00","id":333686,"title":"","content":"&quot;We ain't people. We're sacks of dead meat full of magic fire, and reasonable folks can see through the lie pretty damn quick. Why do we try so hard to be people when we're clearly not? You don't see fish chirping and flapping their fins, trying to fly; that would be crazy. No, we ain't people, and we should stop trying to be. But those Freaks prove we can be something a hell of a lot better. I think they're closer to the truth than all us dupes on the Pilgrimage.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T20:58:47-08:00","id":333734,"title":"","content":"Funny place, the North Pole. The Riven have their Siberian roots, and the Wretched Old Man himself supposedly tried to go to the ends of the earth up in the Arctic. Human children half the world over believe a wish-granting saint lives there, attended by a host of tireless fairy helpers. The Romans called the north wind &quot;Aquilo,&quot; and some of the books I've read say the name shares an origin with their word for the eagle. Ever heard of a place called Hyperborea? Ever read the fable of the North Wind and the Sun? Ever wonder why we call the completion of the Great Work &quot;Aurora&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T10:39:44-08:00","id":334335,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Quo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/327799-rumors-prometheans-pandorans-and-the-principles?p=333216#post333216\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;You see the Qashmallim? Well they have opposites, like; they're the electricity and these demons are the machines. Honest to Verney, and there's one up a ways north of Boston. He lives inside an antique dealer and trades in souls and I know someone who bought one! This is our ticket to mortality, man! What did he trade? I think he just did a few favors. How bad could it be?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nah, I heard something different. We're &quot;in between&quot;, right? Not living, not inert- hell, even the leeches aren't outright rejected the same way we are. Well, I heard that these demons are machines alright- but have you ever seen a qashmal that looked like it was a machine? I bet these demons are like us- they aren't... whatever they used to be, but they aren't qashmallim either; maybe if we guide one on a pilgrimage- help it become a true qashmal, or whatever, it'll reward us with the New Dawn. What could it hurt?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-09T00:32:24-08:00","id":334908,"title":"","content":"Pandorans trying to eat us, mobs trying to kill us, and that's not including all the other things out there in the shadows just waiting to fuck with us. Ever wonder whey we aren't all wiped out from the earth? It ain't 'cause there's so few of us.<br /> <br /> You see, every Family has a Guardian! One Created who forgoes the Pligramige for a few centuries to watch over his &quot;descendants&quot; before passing the baton off to someone else. Sure there are only a few us, but it's also because there are like four or five ridiculously powerful Created who are watching over the flock.<br /> <br /> An old Throngmate of mine told me that the Osiris himself still walks the Sarah to this day, helping his wayward &quot;children&quot; find their way to mortality for a price. The fire inside him has grown into like a mini sun. The question is, why hasn't he moved on to the New Dawn? How powerful is he?<br /> <br /> What's his price?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3857-kingme1","name":"Kingme1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}